# Grok Bot agent targeting

When sending instructions to an existing Grok Bot agent:

1. Name the target first: `WHATSAPP_SCANNER`, `BUYER_RESEARCHER`, `FORM_OPERATOR`, `OPPORTUNITY_RESEARCHER`, etc.
2. Open that agent (`grokbot://agent/<id>` is not enough by itself).
3. Verify the **active chat** is that named agent before any clipboard paste or keystroke. Proof is the sidebar/header showing that name, or `lastViewedAt` on that agent becoming the newest. If proof is missing, **stop**.
4. Never paste into whichever Grok Bot chat happens to be frontmost.
5. Keep responsibilities isolated. Do not send Oliver/WhatsApp ingest or handoff work to `FORM_OPERATOR` or `BUYER_RESEARCHER`. Do not send form jobs to `WHATSAPP_SCANNER`.

